      "status": "accepted",
      "explanation": "Replace the O(n^2) insertion\u2011sort loop with an O(n log n) sort that reproduces the exact ordering semantics. The original code inserts each new value before any equal existing value, yielding descending original\u2011index order for ties. By pairing each value with its original index and sorting by (value, -index) we obtain the same final order while using std::sort, dramatically reducing runtime for large n while preserving observable behavior.",
